				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4686a02 elementor-section-boxed ang-section-padding-initial elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover" data-id="4686a02" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
							<div class="elementor-row">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3a99c63 elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover" data-id="3a99c63" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated">
							<div class="elementor-widget-wrap">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-00d6dff elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="00d6dff" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Email Marketing Software FAQs</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a4901d elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7a4901d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why use email marketing software?</h3>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53458cb elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="53458cb" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
								<div class="elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix">
				<p>Email marketing has been proven as the best way to grow a business. With a return on investment of 36:1, email marketing delivers an unmatched ROI. Additionally, email marketing is easy to create, send, and track. And email marketing has powerful features including personalization, automation, segmentation and more to help you market your business.</p>					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ec19060 elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ec19060" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How does email marketing software work?</h3>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cd717c5 elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cd717c5" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
								<div class="elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix">
				<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Email marketing services work by facilitating the function of creating, sending and tracking email campaigns. </span></p><p>They will typically have:</p><ul><li>an HTML or drag and drop email editor</li><li>ability to segment contacts based on data or actions</li><li>facilitate reporting of opens, clicks, bounces, unsubscribes, complaints, and more</li><li>offer templates and inspiration to help save time</li><li>have content and support to help you create email campaigns</li><li>help grow email subscriber lists by allowing you to build a sign up form to collect email addresses</li><li>have split A/B testing capabilities</li><li>ability to send <a href="https://www.icontact.com/bulk-email-marketing-services/">bulk emails</a> efficiently</li></ul>					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f6eea16 elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f6eea16" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How much does email marketing software cost?</h3>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-38c2a83 elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="38c2a83" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
								<div class="elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix">
				<p>Different email marketing providers offer different pricing structures, but certain factors — the number of contacts and additional features you need — will influence the cost. You can start with a free plan or for as low as $20/month to use more features.</p><p><br style="font-weight: 400;" /><br style="font-weight: 400;" /></p>					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
						</div>
					</div>
		</div>
								</div>
					</div>
		</section>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
				<div data-elementor-type="footer" data-elementor-id="403" class="elementor elementor-403 elementor-location-footer">
					<div class="elementor-section-wrap">
								<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-12390895 sk-dark-bg elementor-section-boxed ang-section-padding-initial elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-repeater-item-none elementor-repeater-item-none_hover" data-id="12390895" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;60e0b6e&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_image&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;jet_parallax_layout_image_tablet&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;jet_parallax_layout_image_mobile&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;jet_parallax_layout_speed&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;%&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:50,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;jet_parallax_layout_type&quot;:&quot;scroll&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_direction&quot;:null,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_fx_direction&quot;:null,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_z_index&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_x&quot;:50,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_x_tablet&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_x_mobile&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_y&quot;:50,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_y_tablet&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_y_mobile&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_size&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_size_tablet&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_bg_size_mobile&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_animation_prop&quot;:&quot;transform&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;]}]}">
